			"notes": "# Create Beyond Limits — v1.0.0\n\n## Full Release\nThis update marks the full release of the mod, transitioning to the NeoForge 1.21.1 platform. Please note that the Forge 1.20.1 version is now deprecated.\n\n## System Overhauls\n\n### Advancement Overhaul\nAdvancement triggers reworked. Progression paths cleaned up to ensure goals are easier to track and verify during gameplay.\n\n### Recipe and Loot Balance\nRecipes and loot tables updated across the mod. Progression flow adjusted for a more natural experience, with rebalanced rewards for exploration and crafting.\n\n## Future Plans\n\n### Mechanical Sprinklers\nDesign phase initiated for a new mechanical sprinkler system. Current plans involve automated crop hydration utilizing mechanical power and fluid piping. This feature remains in early conceptual stages."
